{"ticker":"OKLO","updated":"2026-11-07T01:45:18Z","profile":{"longName":"Oklo Inc.","shortName":"Oklo Inc.","sector":"Utilities","industry":"Utilities - Independent Power Producers","country":"United States","website":"https://www.oklo.com","fullTimeEmployees":215,"marketCap":4380715520,"trailingPE":null,"forwardPE":-22.130547,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3620.426,"pegRatio":null,"targetMeanPrice":65.25,"targetHighPrice":122.0,"targetLowPrice":14.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":20,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":null,"earningsGrowth":null,"grossMargins":0.40412998,"operatingMargins":-60.4876,"profitMargins":0.0,"totalRevenue":1210000,"beta":1.313,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":117.44,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":18.535,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Oklo Inc. develops fission power plants to provide energy at scale to customers in the United States. The company offers Aurora Powerhouse, which is designed to produce between 15 and up to 75 megawatts of electricity. It is also commercializing nuclear fuel recycling and fuel fabrication technology that can convert used nuclear fuel into usable fuel for its reactors. The company was formerly known as AltC Acquisition Corp. and changed its name to Oklo Inc. in May 2024. Oklo Inc. was founded in 2013 and is headquartered in Santa Clara, California.","summary_zh":"Oklo Inc. 開發裂變發電廠，為美國客戶大規模提供能源。該公司提供 Aurora Powerhouse，設計發電量為 15 至 75 兆瓦。它還正在將核燃料回收和燃料製造技術商業化，這些技術可以將用過的核燃料轉化為反應器可用的燃料。該公司前身為 AltC Acquisition Corp.，於 2024 年 5 月更名為 Oklo Inc.。 Oklo Inc. 成立於 2013 年，總部位於加州聖克拉拉。","sector_zh":"公用事業","industry_zh":"公用事業 - 獨立電力生產商","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-08","o":70.5,"h":71.929,"l":69.61,"c":70.72,"v":7781800},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":70.44,"h":74.48,"l":69.55,"c":73.97,"v":12162800},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":75.44,"h":76.7,"l":73.3,"c":73.75,"v":10834300},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":74.18,"h":80.88,"l":73.13,"c":79.97,"v":19906200},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":78.9,"h":83.0,"l":78.67,"c":82.71,"v":12597000},{"t"